1
00:00:00,339 --> 00:00:02,739
(Howard:)You believe in your religion,
I'll believe in mine.

2
00:00:05,678 --> 00:00:07,248
(Amy:)How's it going
in there?

3
00:00:07,246 --> 00:00:08,346
(Penny:)Eh.

4
00:00:08,347 --> 00:00:11,177
(Penny:)Not really a great outfit
for work,

5
00:00:11,183 --> 00:00:15,583
(Penny:)unless something opens up in
the hookers and whores division.

6
00:00:15,588 --> 00:00:18,518
(Penny:)Hey, can I ask you
something?
Sure.

7
00:00:18,524 --> 00:00:21,194
(Penny:)Do I really force you
to do things you don't want to?

8
00:00:21,193 --> 00:00:23,363
(Amy:)Yeah, but it's okay.

9
00:00:23,362 --> 00:00:24,532
(Penny:)How is it okay?

10
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:26,900
(Amy:)I promised myself,
if I ever got friends,

11
00:00:26,899 --> 00:00:28,999
(Amy:)I'd do whatever they said.

12
00:00:30,236 --> 00:00:33,366
(Amy:)Really, I'm lucky you found me
before a cult did.

13
00:00:33,372 --> 00:00:36,372
(Penny:)Well, you know,
that was a long time ago.

14
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:39,205
(Penny:)You're a different woman now.
You're smart,

15
00:00:39,211 --> 00:00:41,741
(Penny:)you've got great friends,
you've got a boyfriend,

16
00:00:41,747 --> 00:00:45,787
(Penny:)you're pretty, you have
zero fashion sense, but...

17
00:00:45,785 --> 00:00:48,255
(Penny:)Anyway, tonight we're gonna do
whatever you want.

18
00:00:48,254 --> 00:00:49,384
(Amy:)Really?

19
00:00:49,388 --> 00:00:51,488
(Penny:)Absolutely.
You name it, we're doing it.

20
00:00:52,224 --> 00:00:55,724
(Amy:)Basket weaving
at the craft museum.

21
00:00:55,728 --> 00:01:03,018
(Penny:)Well, you named it.

